<title>USA: Alabama building authority bond sale postponed.</title>
<headline>Alabama building authority bond sale postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Alabama Building Renovation Finance Authority's $25.545 million refunding revenue bond issue, originally slated for competitive sale on Sept 10, has been moved to 48-hours notice, market sources said Friday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
